 "notes": "Sparse map: Kebal is also known as 'Keba / Krnica Beach', so it is drawn at the beach on the east shore of Luka Krnica, 300 m south of the Krnicadive centre; shoreline and beach from OpenStreetMap. Shore-dive facts for the Krnica shore (Obala Krnice, istra.hr site 33): easy entry, rocky and sandy bottom from 3 to 12 m, most interesting at 7-8 m, sea bottom around 29 m further out. The exact dive spot is not published, so no route or reef edge is drawn. The site coordinates were in Krnica village, 2.7 km inland.",
